        "text",
        "kind",
        "count",
        "rounds"
      ],
      "description": "v3.2: A deterministic \"lesson learned\" — a constraint or verification\ncheck that failed repeatedly across rounds. Rendered in the prompt to\nimmunize the agent against repeating the same mistakes. Zero persistence:\nderived from vault entries each round; presentation only — never feeds\nthe enforcement gate's decisions."
    },
